SUMMARY:Forgotten Island (2026)
LOCATION:Kennedy School Theater\, 5736 NE 33rd Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5613;-122.6481
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Januel Mercado · 109 min\n\nWhile celebrating their last 
